// Co-located with `text_host_string_roundtrip_holds` so glob discovery finds the witness without the central roster.
// Consolidation #4553 Phase 2 distributed BoolWitnessClaim marker.
// Co-located with `text_host_string_empty_roundtrip_holds` so glob discovery finds the witness without the central roster.
// Consolidation #4553 Phase 2 distributed BoolWitnessClaim marker.
// Co-located with `text_host_string_field_text_holds` so glob discovery finds the witness without the central roster.